#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__applies_prima
msgid ""
"The garnishment applies to the service bonus payslips, and the service "
"bonus (also the one paid in the final settlement) is part of its base."
msgstr ""
"El embargo aplica a las nóminas de prima de servicios, y la prima "
"(también la pagada en la liquidación de contrato) hace parte de su base."

#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__applies_severance
msgid ""
"The garnishment applies to the severance payslips, and the severance "
"(also the one paid in the final settlement) is part of its base."
msgstr ""
"El embargo aplica a las nóminas de cesantías, y las cesantías (también "
"las pagadas en la liquidación de contrato) hacen parte de su base."

#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__applies_severance_interest
msgid ""
"The garnishment applies to the severance interest payslips, and the "
"severance interest (also the one paid in the final settlement) is part of "
"its base."
msgstr ""
"El embargo aplica a las nóminas de intereses de cesantías, y los "
"intereses de cesantías (también los pagados en la liquidación de "
"contrato) hacen parte de su base."

#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__applies_vacation
msgid ""
"The garnishment applies to the vacation payslips, and the vacation "
"compensated in the final settlement is part of its base."
msgstr ""
"El embargo aplica a las nóminas de vacaciones, y las vacaciones "
"compensadas en la liquidación de contrato hacen parte de su base."





#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__skip_legal_ceiling
msgid "Ignore Minimum Wage Ceiling"
msgstr "No Respetar Tope Legal (SMMLV)"

#. module: hr_payroll_co
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll_co.field_hr_embargo__skip_legal_ceiling
msgid ""
"Check it when the court order sets the amount to discount directly (e.g. "
"an executive garnishment of 30% of the salary from a cooperative): the "
"garnishment then discounts exactly what its percentage or fixed "
"installment gives, before or after social security according to its "
"configuration, without respecting the combined legal ceiling (a fifth of "
"the amount exceeding the minimum wage, or 50% of the earnings for "
"alimony), and does not consume that ceiling for the other garnishments of "
"the employee."
msgstr ""
"Márquelo cuando la medida del juzgado indique directamente el valor a "
"descontar (p. ej. un embargo ejecutivo del 30% del salario de una "
"cooperativa): el embargo descuenta exactamente lo que da su porcentaje o "
"cuota fija, antes o después de la seguridad social según su "
"configuración, sin respetar el tope legal conjunto (la quinta parte de lo "
"que exceda el salario mínimo, o el 50% de los devengos para alimentos), y "
"no consume ese tope para los demás embargos del empleado."

